WEBVTT

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.680
Look, Shouta.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:49.540
Everyone is blaming me because you won't do things properly.

00:01:51.610 --> 00:01:52.470
I...

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.540
get so tired of being around you!

00:02:00.820 --> 00:02:01.400
Mother...

00:02:04.790 --> 00:02:05.640
Wait!

00:02:06.260 --> 00:02:07.700
Don't leave me!

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:09.090
Let me go!

00:02:09.090 --> 00:02:09.910
Shouta-kun!

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:11.820
Mother!

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:15.880
Shou-chan!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:22.280
Yuzuyu-chan.

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.010
Really, it's...

00:02:48.390 --> 00:02:49.080
Katakura.

00:02:50.990 --> 00:02:54.180
You said that you'd come late, but you never showed up.

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:55.620
Don't skip.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:56.970
I'm sorry.

00:02:57.500 --> 00:03:00.200
Everyone worked on this, so you should too.

00:03:01.480 --> 00:03:03.470
It's morning, so go work on it in the library.

00:03:10.810 --> 00:03:11.730
Check this out!

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:12.510
Aki, be quiet!

00:03:17.470 --> 00:03:18.070
Kippei?

00:03:20.070 --> 00:03:20.800
Kokoro-chin.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:22.710
I want to sit here.

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:25.010
Sure.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:27.450
You seem down?

00:03:29.050 --> 00:03:29.740
What's wrong?

00:03:35.270 --> 00:03:38.920
I hit Yuzuyu once.

00:03:40.410 --> 00:03:44.360
She hit Shou-chan!

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.550
What do you do for a child?

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:49.570
What can you do?

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:53.680
It's not like your little tea party!

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.870
I'm sorry... Just for a bit...

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:11.820
Kippei...

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:15.920
What's wrong?

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.740
Hello, Mom?

00:04:29.370 --> 00:04:33.250
I'm sorry, but could you pick up Yuzuyu today?

00:04:34.440 --> 00:04:36.130
Yeah, please.

00:04:38.880 --> 00:04:40.150
Well, I'm going.

00:04:41.320 --> 00:04:42.120
Go for it.

00:05:02.340 --> 00:05:03.310
It's Nashiya-san.

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:05.520
Did you hear about what happened the other day?

00:05:06.030 --> 00:05:07.020
Really?

00:05:15.610 --> 00:05:16.320
Hello.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:21.130
I looked you up in the preschool directory and came here.

00:05:22.060 --> 00:05:23.240
What do you want?

00:05:23.930 --> 00:05:25.500
Weren't you going to stop sticking your nose in other people's business?

00:05:27.110 --> 00:05:27.630
I...

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:33.580
have never tried to be like a parent to Yuzuyu.

00:05:35.340 --> 00:05:35.920
It's just that...

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.690
I want to share my feelings with her.

00:05:48.210 --> 00:05:50.080
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:06:03.610 --> 00:06:05.030
Because Yuzuyu sees me...

00:06:06.060 --> 00:06:08.090
Because Yuzuyu turns to me...

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.350
That's why I want to return her feelings.

00:06:13.240 --> 00:06:14.950
Isn't a simple reason like that enough?

00:06:24.220 --> 00:06:27.510
If you don't notice soon, you'll just become more and more distant from each other.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:39.790
No...

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:42.790
It's not like that...

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.290
It's not like that at all.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.080
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.160
You're back!

00:07:01.220 --> 00:07:02.160
What are you doing?

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:04.790
She wouldn't listen to me.  She wanted to go get you.

00:07:05.070 --> 00:07:06.390
Piggy back! Piggy back!

00:07:06.870 --> 00:07:07.410
Okay, okay.

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:15.350
So, how did it go?

00:07:15.770 --> 00:07:16.240
Well...

00:07:16.660 --> 00:07:17.610
Well, what?

00:07:18.460 --> 00:07:19.080
Nee-chan.

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:23.180
She told me not to tell,

00:07:24.780 --> 00:07:26.590
but Yuzuyu's mom came the other day.

00:07:28.270 --> 00:07:29.670
I never heard about this!

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.490
That's because she told me not to tell.

00:07:32.650 --> 00:07:34.390
You should tell me things like that!

00:07:34.390 --> 00:07:36.710
Shh.  You'll wake Yuzuyu up.

00:07:42.120 --> 00:07:45.460
She said she's scared to be around Yuzuyu because she hit her.

00:07:47.830 --> 00:07:51.950
But Yuzuyu and that boy both want to stay with their parents, right?

00:07:53.680 --> 00:07:56.150
Since your parents mean everything to you when you're young.

00:07:59.170 --> 00:08:01.060
I wonder why adults don't understand that.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:02.660
It's too strange.

00:08:04.320 --> 00:08:06.960
Different people have different situations.

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:10.870
Yuzuyu-chan is lucky to have you.

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:20.220
It was good that you were around.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:27.060
Onee-sama!

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:27.780
Die.

00:09:08.010 --> 00:09:08.700
Mother!

00:09:08.700 --> 00:09:09.290
Watch out!

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:22.950
I'm sorry.

00:09:23.950 --> 00:09:24.910
You...!

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:14.240
Oh, what's wrong?

00:10:16.080 --> 00:10:16.880
Shouta-kun?

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:18.160
Oh my god!

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.160
Madam!

00:10:20.020 --> 00:10:21.560
Madam?

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.180
Madam?!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.360
When did I become like this?

00:10:43.440 --> 00:10:45.130
He cried a lot at night.

00:10:45.960 --> 00:10:47.830
Hey, he's crying.

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.840
Come on, Shou-chan.  What's wrong?

00:10:56.060 --> 00:10:57.340
Mama's here.

00:11:00.940 --> 00:11:01.570
Hey.

00:11:06.580 --> 00:11:08.010
Come on now.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:16.590
I never understood how hard the night could be until I had a child.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:25.990
And then...

00:11:47.560 --> 00:11:49.670
Just having a child watch television all day?

00:11:51.810 --> 00:11:52.820
I'm going.

00:12:10.020 --> 00:12:11.050
Yes, that's right.

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:12.650
A child has fallen down the stairs.

00:12:13.220 --> 00:12:14.400
Please come quickly!

00:12:15.000 --> 00:12:17.260
Please!  Hurry!  Hurry!

00:12:29.860 --> 00:12:30.630
Truck!

00:12:35.000 --> 00:12:37.350
I'm sorry.  He's still a baby.

00:12:37.730 --> 00:12:39.550
If you'd like, could you play with him?

00:12:39.860 --> 00:12:41.530
Yuusuke, come over here.

00:12:41.930 --> 00:12:42.740
Okay.

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:51.940
Come here and play with the usual kids.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:01.750
Mother.

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:04.520
I want a truck.

00:13:05.010 --> 00:13:05.630
Let's go home.

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.140
Huh?  We're going home?

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:09.310
I don't want to.

00:13:09.630 --> 00:13:10.300
Just come on.

00:13:39.820 --> 00:13:40.510
Welcome home.

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.090
You're early.  Did something happen?

00:13:49.050 --> 00:13:51.360
I quit my job.

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:01.510
I knew it was hard on him,

00:14:03.150 --> 00:14:06.030
but I couldn't be nice even if I wanted to.

00:14:19.820 --> 00:14:21.810
It's a minor concussion.

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:24.640
There are no serious problems now,

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.810
but just in case, he should stay in the hospital today.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:34.320
By the way, I need to speak to you a little later, if that's okay with you.

00:14:39.570 --> 00:14:44.390
There are bruises all over Shouta-kun's body.

00:14:46.740 --> 00:14:54.790
It's like from being hit many times on a regular basis.

00:14:56.390 --> 00:14:58.080
Do you have any idea what I'm talking about?

00:14:59.610 --> 00:15:01.520
When did I become like this?

00:15:02.810 --> 00:15:04.200
When did I become like this?

00:15:06.540 --> 00:15:07.460
Mother.

00:15:14.050 --> 00:15:15.210
Nashiya-san.

00:15:18.620 --> 00:15:20.810
Today, Shouta-kun has...

00:15:22.450 --> 00:15:23.200
Don't!

00:15:24.260 --> 00:15:25.400
Stop calling me!

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:27.040
Don't corner me!

00:15:30.190 --> 00:15:30.850
You...

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:35.210
I heard that Shouta fell down the stairs!

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.730
Where is Shouta?!

00:15:37.420 --> 00:15:38.120
Dear...

00:15:38.520 --> 00:15:40.810
Are you Shouta-kun's father?

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.120
Yes.

00:15:42.810 --> 00:15:44.720
Could you sit down for a moment?

00:15:45.060 --> 00:15:47.370
If you're worried about Shouta-kun, he's fine.

00:15:47.870 --> 00:15:51.780
If he rests today and tomorrow, then he will be able to go to preschool the day after tomorrow.

00:15:56.670 --> 00:15:58.240
Sir.  Ma'am.

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:02.830
Are you familiar with the family counseling available at a child consultation center?

00:16:04.350 --> 00:16:09.410
Problems can be solved if the family comes to understand each other's way of doing things.

00:16:10.070 --> 00:16:14.440
If you ask for help, people will help you.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.030
At home... Well...

00:16:32.240 --> 00:16:35.230
I left the house after I locked up.

00:16:36.040 --> 00:16:37.050
All the laundry was folded.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:39.230
It was so sloppy.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:43.140
I knew right away that Shouta did it.

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:49.400
He probably did it because he wanted to help you.

00:16:58.890 --> 00:17:03.910
I've been a burden lately, and I never thought about doing anything for you.

00:17:05.630 --> 00:17:07.000
I'm  a worthless father.

00:17:09.630 --> 00:17:10.280
No...

00:17:11.390 --> 00:17:12.190
It's not like that...

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.260
It's not like that at all...

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:18.390
It's not the child who's bad.

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:21.910
When did I become like this?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:23.680
I'm not...

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.020
I'm not really like this.

00:17:27.640 --> 00:17:29.910
I truly... love him.

00:17:31.420 --> 00:17:34.530
I really... want to love him more.

00:17:57.490 --> 00:17:58.120
Shouta.

00:18:00.590 --> 00:18:01.390
Mother?

00:18:02.450 --> 00:18:04.060
Shouta, I'm sorry.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:06.640
Mother, I...

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:09.130
folded the laundry.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.010
I was able to help.

00:18:13.180 --> 00:18:14.030
Shouta...

00:18:22.750 --> 00:18:23.580
Father.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.620
Next time, I'll help you.

00:18:27.290 --> 00:18:30.060
Okay, I'll teach you.

00:18:43.810 --> 00:18:44.550
Hello.

00:18:45.930 --> 00:18:46.740
Shou-chan!

00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:47.350
Yo!

00:18:48.320 --> 00:18:51.810
I'm drawing right now.

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:56.860
Oh?

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:03.510
Is Shouta-kun all right now?

00:19:04.510 --> 00:19:06.790
Yes, he's fine now.

00:19:07.420 --> 00:19:10.130
We've decided to move back to my home town.

00:19:12.500 --> 00:19:18.580
If we move back to the suburbs, my husband may be able to find a job and we can live a quiet life.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:19.860
I see.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:21.060
That's great.

00:19:21.610 --> 00:19:25.670
Also, I have decided to get help from many different people...

00:19:26.830 --> 00:19:28.860
so I won't have to carry the burden alone.

00:19:31.510 --> 00:19:33.570
I don't know if I can do it,

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:36.550
but just once more...

00:19:45.800 --> 00:19:49.600
I want to go back to how I was and start over.

00:19:57.500 --> 00:19:58.800
What are you peeking at?

00:19:58.940 --> 00:19:59.390
Shh.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.190
What?  Moving?

00:20:02.530 --> 00:20:06.900
My family is going to move back to my grandparents' home.

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:10.340
So, this is bye-bye.

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:14.310
You're going away, Shou-chan?

00:20:14.460 --> 00:20:14.890
Yeah.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:16.050
Shouta!

00:20:17.660 --> 00:20:18.360
Mother!

00:20:22.670 --> 00:20:25.670
My mom is actually much nicer.

00:20:29.550 --> 00:20:31.610
Thank you for looking out for Shouta.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:32.760
No problem.

00:20:33.170 --> 00:20:33.720
Goodbye.

00:20:38.900 --> 00:20:40.390
Shouta, get in.

00:20:42.020 --> 00:20:42.420
Okay.

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:49.080
Yuzuyu.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:52.840
I'll always be your friend.

00:20:53.320 --> 00:20:54.820
Don't cry when you fall, okay?

00:20:57.810 --> 00:20:58.440
See you.

00:21:29.370 --> 00:21:32.630
I liked Shou-chan a lot!

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:33.690
First love, huh?

00:23:37.340 --> 00:23:39.020
Why are you sulking?

00:23:39.600 --> 00:23:44.120
Yuzuyu's feelings for you are familial love.

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.640
You got that?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:48.700
That's not...!

00:23:51.410 --> 00:23:52.620
I know.

00:23:54.570 --> 00:23:55.530
Shut up!

00:23:55.940 --> 00:23:57.390
Leave me alone!

00:23:57.910 --> 00:23:59.520
You're the loud one.

00:24:18.900 --> 00:24:19.870
It's summer!

00:24:20.180 --> 00:24:22.900
Summer!  I love ice cream!

00:24:23.090 --> 00:24:24.340
Speaking of summer, it's pool time!

00:24:24.600 --> 00:24:25.500
We're going to swim.

00:24:25.630 --> 00:24:26.860
P-Pool?

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:28.790
Huh?  Yuzuyu?  What's wrong?

00:24:29.040 --> 00:24:31.160
No pool!  I hate it!

00:24:31.310 --> 00:24:32.250
What?  Really?

00:24:32.660 --> 00:24:35.760
Okay.  As your guardian, I will coach you.

00:24:36.830 --> 00:24:38.680
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:39.100 --> 00:24:41.550
It's a Pool, It's a Swimsuit, I'm Scared.

00:24:42.300 --> 00:24:44.800
Kippei-onii-chan, I hate it!

00:24:45.430 --> 00:24:46.710
Kokoro-chan is in a swimsuit!
